<TD><A HREF="whichcar/november1992/article.html"><IMG SRC="whichcar/november1992/cover.jpg" BORDER=0 WIDTH=191 HEIGHT=255 ALT="Which Car?" HSPACE=10></A></TD>
<TD>An article from the November 1992 edition of &quot;Which Car?&quot;
The magazine lists the top cars in various classes on sale in Britain at the
time. The Tipo was placed in the &quot;Performance&quot; section together with
an Affa Romeo 164, BMW 325i, Citroen ZX Volcane, Ford Escort Cosworth, Lancia
Delta Integrale, Peugeot 106 XSi, Renault Clio 16v, Renault 19 16V and Vauxhall
Carlton. The Renault 19 16V was voted performance car of the year.</TD>
</TR>
</TABLE>

